{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51230","headline":"五言诗 十 · 缺名","name":"五言诗 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹔得一代人，风光亦须觅。\n（张锡厚以止二句属另一首。\n）金玉不成宝，{戒廾=天}身实可惜。\n（「{戒廾=天}」，项楚校作「宍」，即「肉」字。\n）白发随年生，美貌别今夕。\n贫富光常空，（「光」，郭在贻校作「无」，即「无」。\n）恣意多着吃。\n活时恠不用，塞墓慎何益？\n（「慎」，戴密微校作「真」。\n）（以上《炖煌掇琐》三○引伯希和卷三四一八。\n诗中别体不明之处，暂未校正（王梵志诗及此无名氏诗所录今人校订意见，皆录自郭在贻《王梵志诗汇校》。\n））。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}